# Normalise line endings at the source. A Windows-host agent writing this repo
# produced a CRLF `routes/attack.py` on 2026-09-01; nothing in the gate set sees
# line terminators, and `black` would have normalised it silently later --
# landing a whole-file diff on whoever next ran the formatter rather than on the
# change that caused it. Silent, deferred, misattributed.
* text=auto eol=lf
